OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStorm Boelo
OL,6,Fwill bring strengthening westerly
OL,7,Fwinds with severe gales developing
OL,8,Fthrough the evening and overnight. The
OL,9,Fstrongest winds will be along the
OL,10,FNorth Coast. Frequent showers will be
OL,11,Fheavy at times.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FStorm Boelo will bring
OL,14,Fwesterly severe gales and frequent
OL,15,Fheavy showers in the morning. Winds
OL,16,Fgradually easing in afternoon with
OL,17,Fsome bright spells developing between
OL,18,Fthe showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
