OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fand bright start Monday, soon turning
OL,7,Fwet and windy. Very windy on Tuesday
OL,8,Fwith showers, some heavy. Bright
OL,9,Fspells and scattered showers on
OL,10,FWednesday.
